  message: "Merged in PR #1417 (dev c5249c1aa1).\n\nFixed on branch jgstern-agent/fix/audit0021-rows, commit 740a3e70a1 (test pins updated in fdb14eb77e). The six elixir BEAM message sends are process_send, matching erlang.yaml's gen_server / erlang:send rows.\n\nBehavioral evidence: `io-boundaries` on a one-file elixir program reports all six under process_send beside the control `:gen_server.call`, and reports no ipc_send. The derived taint sink zone is unchanged (`ipc`).\n\nCorpus A/B on phoenix-framework, plausible-analytics and livebook: the counts move label-for-label (e.g. livebook GenServer.cast 82 ipc_send → 82 process_send), and no other primitive pair changes because of these rows.\n\nResidual filed: elixir spellings of other BEAM sends and spawns are unrowed (WI-vahad)."  # 63ce
